{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find object, if close then take it, if not move to it, check properties, complete task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
